      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由于} P(\\overline{B})=0.3,\\text{则} P(B)=0.7,\\text{由概率的性质}\\\\ &amp; \\qquad P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(AB),\\\\ &amp; \\text{所以} P(AB)=0.8+0.7-0.9=0.6,\\text{再根据条件概率公式}\\\\ &amp; \\qquad P(B|A)=\\frac{P(AB)}{P(A)}=\\frac{0.6}{0.8}=0.75\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由于} P(\\overline{B})=0.3,\\text{则} P(B)=0.7,\\text{由概率的性质}\\\\ &amp; \\qquad P(A\\cup B)=P(A)+P(B)-P(AB),\\\\ &amp; \\text{所以} P(AB)=0.8+0.7-0.9=0.6,\\text{再根据条件概率公式}\\\\ &amp; \\qquad P(B|A)=\\frac{P(AB)}{P(A)}=\\frac{0.6}{0.8}=0.75\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
