      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}P(AB) &amp;= P(A)-P(A\\overline{B}) = P(A)-P(A-B) = 0.7-0.3=0.4, \\\\P(B-A) &amp;= P(B)-P(AB) = 0.5-0.4=0.1, \\\\P(\\overline{B}|A) &amp;= \\frac{P(A\\cap \\overline{B})}{P(A)} = \\frac{P(A\\cup B)}{P(A)} = \\frac{1-[P(A)+P(B)-P(AB)]}{1-P(A)} = \\frac{2}{3}. \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}P(AB) &amp;= P(A)-P(A\\overline{B}) = P(A)-P(A-B) = 0.7-0.3=0.4, \\\\P(B-A) &amp;= P(B)-P(AB) = 0.5-0.4=0.1, \\\\P(\\overline{B}|A) &amp;= \\frac{P(A\\cap \\overline{B})}{P(A)} = \\frac{P(A\\cup B)}{P(A)} = \\frac{1-[P(A)+P(B)-P(AB)]}{1-P(A)} = \\frac{2}{3}. \\end{aligned}</div>"
