      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{因为 } A \\subset B \\text{，所以 } AB = A \\, , \\ A \\cup B \\, , \\ \\overline{A \\cup B} = \\overline{AB} \\, , \\text{故} \\\\ P(AB) = P(A) = 0.1 \\, , \\quad P(A|B) = \\frac{P(BA)}{P(B)} = 0.2 \\, , \\\\ P(\\overline{A \\cup B}) = P(\\overline{AB}) = 1 - P(AB) = 0.9 \\, , \\\\ \\text{所以 } P(\\overline{A \\cup B}) + P(A|B) - P(AB) = 1.0 \\, . \\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{因为 } A \\subset B \\text{，所以 } AB = A \\, , \\ A \\cup B \\, , \\ \\overline{A \\cup B} = \\overline{AB} \\, , \\text{故} \\\\ P(AB) = P(A) = 0.1 \\, , \\quad P(A|B) = \\frac{P(BA)}{P(B)} = 0.2 \\, , \\\\ P(\\overline{A \\cup B}) = P(\\overline{AB}) = 1 - P(AB) = 0.9 \\, , \\\\ \\text{所以 } P(\\overline{A \\cup B}) + P(A|B) - P(AB) = 1.0 \\, . \\end{aligned}</div>"
